# Judge2-4-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Flushed_Open1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……我是在惩罚室<br>找到这把钥匙的。<br>|#0102Trial04_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Uncomfortable_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我是今天<br>【晚上8点后】<br>去的惩罚室……|#0102Trial04_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Normal_Open4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:在亲眼确认<br>远野汉娜她们离开后，<br>我才进了<br>惩罚室。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你看到<br>我们了……！？|#0102Trial04_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Uncomfortable_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:是啊，<br>因为你们<br>太吵了。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我打开惩罚室的门时，<br>门并没有上锁。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Neutral_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:可是我<br>进门后一看……<br>佐伯米莉亚已经是<br>一具鲜血淋漓的<br>尸体了。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那就是说，你在<br>【晚9点】之前<br>就发现了<br>尸体！<br>|#0102Trial04_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:就是这样。<br>我进去以后<br>检查了一下浑身是血的<br>佐伯米莉亚的脉搏，<br>确认她已经死亡。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL9,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这把【钥匙】<br>也是我那时<br>在惩罚室的地上找到的。<br>我想着把它插进门锁试试看，<br>结果能把门锁上……|#0102Trial04_Nanoka008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Surprised,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那锁房门的人是……<br>|#0102Trial04_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1,ArmR2,
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:是我。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:为什么要锁门……！|#0102Trial04_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Normal_Closed1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:手里有钥匙的<br>只有典狱长和看守<br>……也就是运营方，<br>所以凶手不在<br>我们当中。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Open1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我只是<br>把事情简单化而已，<br>以便让我们<br>团结一心。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka011| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你就是在骗我们吧！<br>……刚才那番话<br>搞不好<br>也是现编的！|#0102Trial04_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Uncomfortable_Open1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……无论如何，<br>当我成为真正的<br>第一发现人时<br>就难免带上<br>最大的嫌疑。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka012| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Angry_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"但我看到<br>佐伯米莉亚的时候<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_04_01\">她</link>就已经死了。<br>然后我<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_04_02\">捡起钥匙锁上了门</link>。<br>……这<link=\"Objection_01_02_04_03\">有什么问题</link>吗？|#0102Trial04_Nanoka013|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:问题可大了！<br>你这家伙！<br>那、那什么来着……！|#0102Trial04_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ＠備考◆罵倒しようと思ったけど感情的になってすぐ出てこなかった
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Comical_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:……你这个大骗子！！|#0102Trial04_Coco003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ＠備考◆申し訳なさそうに
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Uncomfortable_Open1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……那我只能<br>接受你的批评了。<br>对不起。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka014| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


